Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}「Drakeって…」ってなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's why I was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}interested when he heard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だから『30 Hours』を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あいつが聴いた時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}'30 Hours,' because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Drake wrote that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}気になったんだよ　あれはDrakeが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}書いてくれたから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I said, I'm like, boom, here, I got, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺は「ほら、アイデアは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}こんなにあるぜ」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}this many ideas, like the line I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}例えば俺が考えた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ラインがあって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I had, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「Victoria's Secretの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I was nervous to do the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Victoria's Secret show
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ショーは緊張したけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}until I pictured everybody
