Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}みんな裸だと思ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}平気だった」ってやつ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Right? Was like a line I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}And like, it's like a stripper line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そういうラインだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}まあストリッパーっぽい　ラインだけどな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Like, yeah, but you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そうそう
