Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, you could be nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to do, like, a speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}スピーチで緊張したら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and they say what they say:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}picture everybody naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「みんな裸だと思え」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}よく言うだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So we flipped it, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I was nervous to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それをひっくり返して
