Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ってのをDrakeに送ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and Drake took it and barred it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}out and wrote the whole rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Drakeがそれを　verseに仕上げて
