Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}どんだけ楽か
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm sure everyone wished
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}they had that luxury, but...
